{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47289","headline":"览古十四首 二 · 吴筠","name":"览古十四首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兴亡道之运，否泰理所全。\n奈何淳古风，既往不复旋。\n三皇已散朴，五帝初尚贤。\n王业与霸功，浮僞日以宣。\n忠诚及狙诈，殽混安可甄。\n余智入九霄，守愚沦重泉。\n永怀巢居时，感涕徒泫然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47289.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47289","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}